   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Whispers of the North**: back after 140 archived shows (1008 days); rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- **Katy Daly**: back after 78 archived shows (623 days); rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2025-11-07.mk21-discocape** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 154 min [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer describes the recording as a good, clean copy of the show [3]\n- **billystrings2025-11-07.mc950.taraszki.flac24**: source not stated; 26 songs; 156 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2025-11-07.mk21-discocape**: taped by discocape; transferred by discocape; source: Schoeps cmc1/mk21 [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps cmc1k/mk21 mics in ORTF, into a Zoom H1n via XLR at 32/48; taped, tracked and transferred by discocape [1]\n- **billystrings2025-11-07.mc950.taraszki.flac24**: taped by Craig Taraszki; transferred by Craig Taraszki; source: Beyerdynamic mc950 (OTS, 10'ROC, DIN, 8'stand)> Zoom F6 (32/48) [2]. Also: Edited with Audacity (normalizing, fades, tracking, FLAC24 export) and tagged with Foobar2000 [2]",
